{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Frame_20.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into an alternate-reality USSR where the past collides with alien technology: monolithic concrete structures tower over glowing extraterrestrial machinery, all brought to life with nostalgic pixel-art flair. Battle across wildly unique maps \u2014 from secret lunar bases to underground bunkers codenamed \u201cVolga-12\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Frame_21.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a roster of eccentric fighters: Baba Yaga, the engineer-inventor piloting a robotic hut-mech, or Kot Uchyony (The Scientist Cat) \u2014 yes, he\u2019s literally a cat and a genius! Each hero boasts a game-changing ultimate ability, like summoning a swarm of cybernetic crows or deploying a reality-warping \u201cCommunism Wave\u201d that turns foes into collectivist zealots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Frame_25.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/chars2.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Frame_22.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every location hides optional side objectives: hack an alien reactor to trigger a \u201cRed Overdrive\u201d buff for your team, or seize control of the giant automaton \u201cKuzmich\u201d to crush enemies with its rocket-powered hammer. Win these mini-wars to gain powerful boosts \u2014 but expect ruthless resistance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Group_919.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Frame_23.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix Cold War-era aesthetics with alien futurism in our deep customization system. Equip your hero with a ushanka hat wired with holographic tech, or strap a vintage gas mask to a cyborg\u2019s glowing visor. Style matters as much as stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/sokol2.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Esports_from_Unexpected_Places.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb the ranks in competitive matches, forge a clan like \u201cCosmoZavod-7\u201d, and battle through leagues with real stakes. Our anti-cheat system and balanced gameplay ensure victory depends on skill \u2014 not exploits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/PvE_Episodes.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up in co-op missions against alien hordes and rogue AI. Uncover the world\u2019s secrets: from humanity\u2019s first contact with extraterrestrials to the rise of the MKPZ \u2014 a USSR-led global defense force.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3187960?t=1751040175","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/5a7e20a191739b1926b683bc392b4c995de7c6ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751040175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/a3af0fdb02de042cfe0eeccc65005a64420af4ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751040175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/a3af0fdb02de042cfe0eeccc65005a64420af4ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751040175","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187960/extras/Frame_20.png?t=1751040175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into an alternate-reality USSR where the past collides with alien technology: monolithic concrete structures tower over glowing extraterrestrial machinery, all brought to life with nostalgic pixel-art flair. Battle across wildly unique maps \u2014 from secret lunar bases to underground bunkers codenamed \u201cVolga-12\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_pa